        "Content": "Leonard Wislon Keenan \r\n\r\nOur Business is you \r\n\r\n2 Bedroom, 1 Bathroom apartment \r\nParking \r\nSold fully furnished \r\n\r\nRichard Todd and Leonard Wilson Keenan are delighted to present 23 Lanesborough Court to the property market.\r\nWelcome to No. 23 Lanesborough Court, a beautifully presented two-bedroom, one-bathroom ground floor apartment ideally positioned within this well-maintained residential development. Sold fully furnished and complete with a designated parking space, this superb property offers an ideal opportunity for first-time buyers, those looking to downsize, or investors seeking a quality home in a convenient location.\r\n\r\nOccupying a desirable corner position directly opposite a large public park, the apartment enjoys an attractive open outlook and greater privacy than many similar properties within the development. On arrival, you are welcomed by a private front courtyard, creating an inviting entrance to the home. Stepping inside, a porch leads into a bright and spacious open-plan living and dining area, where a large front-facing window allows an abundance of natural light to fill the room, creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere. The separate fitted kitchen is well laid out and comes complete with all appliances, offering ample storage and workspace while remaining conveniently connected to the main living area.\r\n\r\nA hallway leads to the remainder of the accommodation, where you will find a well-appointed family bathroom finished with quality sanitary ware. The apartment offers two generously proportioned bedrooms, comprising one spacious double bedroom and one comfortable single bedroom. The double bedroom benefits from direct access to a private rear courtyard, which provides a peaceful outdoor space and convenient access to the designated parking area.\r\n\r\nExternally, residents benefit from designated parking, secure fob access to the bin storage area, and a beautifully maintained communal enclosed garden and children's play area to the rear of the development. The combination of both front and rear outdoor spaces further enhances the appeal of this attractive ground floor apartment.\r\n\r\nLanesborough Court enjoys an excellent location directly opposite a large park, providing wonderful green space for walking, recreation and outdoor activities. The area is well served by a range of primary and secondary schools, together with an excellent selection of shops, supermarkets, cafés and local services. Charlestown Shopping Centre, IKEA, Dublin City University and the National Aquatic Centre are all within easy reach. The property also benefits from excellent transport links, with numerous Dublin Bus routes servicing the area and the nearby M50 motorway providing easy access to Dublin City Centre, which is approximately 8km away, and Dublin Airport, located approximately 10km from the property.\r\n\r\nCombining spacious accommodation, private outdoor areas, a designated parking space and an exceptionally convenient location, No. 23 Lanesborough Court is a wonderful home that is sure to appeal to a wide range of purchasers.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
